# Maven dependency false positive
# guava is resolved to 33.7.2-jre via dependencyManagement in pom.xml.
# Trivy's static pom parser sees 33.5.0-jre from iceberg-bundled-guava's
# transitive dependency, but Maven overrides it.
CVE-2026-102554

